  "description": {
    "en": "MSV Focus Hex Plus 38 is the softest co-polyester string in the MSV lineup, offering approximately 38% greater elasticity than the original Focus Hex. Designed for players using stiff racquet frames or seeking maximum arm comfort, it combines a very soft response with the spin benefits of a hexagonal profile and strong snapback. Despite its high flexibility, it retains excellent control and minimal string movement. The 1.25 mm version has a manufacturer-recommended tension range of 22 to 26 kg.",

    "zh": "MSV Focus Hex Plus 38 是 MSV 系列中最柔和的共聚酯球线，官方表示其弹性相比标准 Focus Hex 提升约 38%。它特别适合使用偏硬球拍框、希望减轻手臂负担，或者需要长时间比赛舒适性的球员。六边形截面和强 Snap-back 保留了非常高的旋转潜力，同时在高柔韧性的情况下仍能提供优秀控制和极低的线床移动。1.25毫米版本官方建议穿线磅数为 22–26 kg（48.5–57.3 lbs）。"
  },

